# Secrets and local state — never commit these.
agent.key.json
*.key.json
*.pem
posted.json
poster.log
.idle-notified
.did-refreshed
.pending.json
.nonces.json
posted.json.tmp

# Belt-and-braces: files from the parent working folder that must never be
# published. Copying one in by mistake is the realistic failure — the parent's
# README.md and this repo's README.md are different documents with the same
# name, and the parent's carries a DID, local paths and machine details.
# Listing them here means git will not stage them even if they land in this
# directory. (This repo's own README.md is tracked and unaffected.)
CLAUDE.md
check-publish.mjs
audit-claude-md.mjs
verify-pending.mjs
data.js
data2.js
codex/
CODEX-検査要件.md
codex-review*.md
codex-stdout*.log
run-codex.ps1
*_判定ページ.html
*.xml
agent.json
llms.txt
patterns.md
skill.md

# BEGIN managed local exclusions (GH-003)
# OS・作業中の一時ファイル
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo

# Node.js
node_modules/
.npm/
.yarn/cache/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
.eslintcache
coverage/

# 環境設定・ローカル認証情報（値は出力・複製しない）
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
!.env.*.example
!.env.*.sample
!.env.*.template
!.dev.vars.example
!.dev.vars.sample
!.dev.vars.template

# この除外設定自体はGitに記録する
!/.gitignore

# END managed local exclusions (GH-003)
